{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "the-old-capital",
  "chunk_id": "the-old-capital-chunk-3037",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03037",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“哪儿都没有病。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There is no illness anywhere.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03037",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "身子孱弱些，但是会长命的。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Your body is somewhat frail, but you will live a long life.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03037",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "东乡马上说了一句。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Togo immediately said this.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03037",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "过了片刻，他又将手掌伸向我的胸口。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After a moment, he again extended his palm toward my chest.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03037",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "我自己试着摸了一下，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I tried touching it myself,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03037",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "只觉得右胸上的棉袍暖和起来了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and only felt that the cotton robe over my right chest had grown warm.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03037",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "真是不可思议啊！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It was truly unbelievable!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03037",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "东乡只是将掌心靠近，并没有触及我，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Togo merely brought his palm close and did not touch me,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03037",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "左右都做了同样的动作，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and he made the same motion on both sides,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03037",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "右边胸口是温乎乎的，左边却是凉飕飕的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "yet the right side of my chest was warm, while the left side was chilly.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03037",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "据东乡说，这温热是经过治疗，右胸向外冒出了类似毒素的东西造成的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "According to Togo, this warmth was caused by the treatment, as something like toxins had come out from my right chest.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03037",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "我的肺和胸膜不曾有过自觉症状，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I had never felt any symptoms in my lungs or pleura,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03037",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "用X光透视也未发现异样，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and an X-ray examination had found nothing abnormal,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03037",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "只是有时右胸发闷，也许是曾经患过轻微肺病的缘故吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "except that my right chest sometimes felt heavy, perhaps because I had once suffered from a mild lung disease.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03037",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "留有病根的右胸的感觉反映了东乡的掌疗法是有功效的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The sensation in my right chest, where the root of the illness remained, showed that Togo's palm therapy was effective.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03037",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "可是怎么能透过棉袍使右胸温热起来呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But how could he make my right chest grow warm through the cotton robe?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03037",
      "unit_index": 17,
      "source_text": "这使我震惊不已。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This left me utterly astonished.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
